# The charges of the generated action expression differential cases (codegentest.MemberActionCases) on every target: the units the
# engine's closure backend, bytecode VM and iterative VM, the node and the typed generated Go parsers and the
# generated TypeScript parser charge for each input, and the outcome (ok, or the error) each reports. The targets
# charge action expressions in their own ways today, so the columns differ; the golden freezes each, so that a change of an
# action expression's charges on one target is a stated change. Some action expressions leave struct fields unset.
# A run checks every entry of its scope: an entry that is missing, stale or different fails. -update replaces the
# entries of the scope, drops stale ones and logs a summary per case. Review the diff: it is a regression freeze.
# One line for each case, then for each part of it: the number of entries, the first 10 hex digits of the SHA-256 of
# the sorted "key<TAB>value" lines of those entries and, for a golden of totals, the sums of the two totals. A
# failing run prints the actual entries of the part whose number or digest differs.
# The part of a case is the target: the last word of the entry's key.
